{"id":"n16738-3-7","stage":3,"title":"씌우다 · 蒙","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16738-3-7-1","ko":"바나나가 많이 남았는데 어쩌지?","zh":"香蕉还剩下好多，怎么办呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바나나가","meaning":"香蕉","explanation":"바나나：香蕉；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바나나","audio":"/audio/5412337d0db0338a236a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31451","senseId":"1","lemma":"바나나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바나나가","audio":"/audio/5bd748353980bcc9dca3.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"남았는데","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남았는데","audio":"/audio/c9075c23c5f654679577.mp3"}},{"text":"어쩌지?","meaning":"怎么办呢","explanation":"어쩌다 在本句是 어찌하다 的缩略，不是表示偶然的副词；-지 表示说话人的自问，어쩌지 是怎么办呢。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91975","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩌지","audio":"/audio/e458e74417e5e016790e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5412337d0db0338a","term":"바나나","zh":"香蕉","audio":"/audio/5412337d0db0338a236a.mp3","entryId":"31451","definition":"一种热带水果。其外形又长又弯；果皮呈黄色，易剥开；果肉呈白色、松软香甜。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]},{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"如何做、怎么办（어찌하다 的缩略）","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"91975","definition":"如何做、怎么办（어찌하다 的缩略）","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/4f9400e9f56fa23841c2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16738-3-7-2","ko":"초콜릿을 씌워서 아이스크림처럼 얼려 먹자.","zh":"用巧克力包起来，像冰淇淋一样冻起来吃吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"초콜릿을","meaning":"巧克力","explanation":"초콜릿：巧克力；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"초콜릿","audio":"/audio/a5b7c153024714c016fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72128","senseId":"1","lemma":"초콜릿","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"초콜릿을","audio":"/audio/1d79efd12c31f0a07440.mp3"}},{"text":"씌워서","meaning":"蒙，罩","explanation":"씌우다：蒙，罩；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"씌우다","audio":"/audio/418e304cf1adfee5d7fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16738","senseId":"3","lemma":"씌우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씌워서","audio":"/audio/3b8d05dc592540cfe557.mp3"}},{"text":"아이스크림처럼","meaning":"冰淇淋","explanation":"아이스크림：冰淇淋；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"아이스크림","audio":"/audio/df604411f541057ddea4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26886","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이스크림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이스크림처럼","audio":"/audio/ad281c078db17ebb92b6.mp3"}},{"text":"얼려","meaning":"冻起，冻","explanation":"얼리다：冻起，冻；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"얼리다","audio":"/audio/4abd207a5beb02baab65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15105","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼려","audio":"/audio/fcc0a3c279fc39f611d4.mp3"}},{"text":"먹자.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹자","audio":"/audio/2344faed1041c2fece65.mp3"}}],"w